he $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})$ in the numerator, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})} & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})}} \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120024" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5e9e5735bfa187a69a964b30ffbb3a2d7fc6bd674feedf05388bb3985742fbd9"} {"question" "q-120024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120024" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{16})"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120058" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the exact value of $\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120058" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{8}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{8}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{8})}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120058" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5e9e5735bfa187a69a964b30ffbb3a2d7fc6bd674feedf05388bb3985742fbd9"} {"question" "q-120058" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120058" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{4}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-120058" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-327771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the exact value of $4\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{15}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{15}^{∘}.$\n\n$4\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡{15}^{∘}\\operatorname{cos}⁡{15}^{∘}=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-327771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's recall the double-angle formula for sine:\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={15}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot {15}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡({30}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) & =2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡({15}^{∘})\\operatorname{cos}⁡({15}^{∘}) \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-327771" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5e9e5735bfa187a69a964b30ffbb3a2d7fc6bd674feedf05388bb3985742fbd9"} {"question" "q-327771" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14050034/state.json" "file_sha256" "5acb24329a24bfffc49a67050f08d98b093ca4125cce61eb78660ae15663ac11"} {"question" "q-327771" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\sqrt{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/refe